{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Achievements are displayed on the player menu, under the \"",["l","收集品","Collections"],"\" tab, on the \"Achievements\" tab found at the bottom left, on every platform other than Xbox and PlayStation. If playing the game on Steam or PlayStation, additional achievements are available."]],["p",["Achievements can unlock specific rewards within the game. Achievements for specific platforms, such as Steam, only need to be achieved once, but the associated rewards must be earned separately for each new game."]],["p",["Unearned achievements appear as grayed-out on the player menu. Some achievements do not display on the player menu until completing other achievements."]],["p",["Note that only in-game achievements are required for ",["l","完美","Perfection"],"."]],["p",["Most achievements unlock a unique ",["l","帽子","hat"]," for sale at the ",["l","废弃的屋子","abandoned house"]," in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],". In addition, the day after earning \"Gofer\" (Complete 10 ",["l","任务","Help Wanted"]," requests), ",["l","刘易斯","Mayor Lewis"]," will send 500g in the mail. The day after earning \"A Big Help\" (Complete 40 ",["l","任务","Help Wanted"]," requests), Mayor Lewis will send 2,500g in the mail. The day after earning \"Master Angler\" (Catch every ",["l","鱼","fish"],"), Willy will send a ",["l","星之果实","Stardrop"]," in the mail."]]]],["Achievements List",2,[["p",["Achievements that do not have an in-game icon are platform-specific achievements. Platforms with extra achievements or trophies beyond (or instead of) the in-game achievements are: Steam, PlayStation, and Xbox."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Platform Icon"]},{"h":1,"v":["In-Game Icon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Achievement"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Unlocks"]}],[[["f","Achievement_Greenhorn.jpg",64]],[["f","Achievement_Star_12.png",64]],["Greenhorn"],["Earn 15,000g"],[["f","Good_Ol'_Cap.png",54]],[["l","老伙计帽","Good Ol' Cap"]]],[[["f","Achievement_Cowpoke.jpg",64]],[["f","Achievement_Star_02